cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Unsupervised Industrial Anomaly Detection & Localization on MVTec AD"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of training-free deep-learning methods (PatchCore, PaDiM) and a
  convolutional autoencoder baseline for unsupervised anomaly detection and
  pixel-level localization on the MVTec AD dataset.
